  "about": "The prices of the models Kie's catalog adds (kie.js reads them from its docs; kie-models.json has its own): Kie's price rows name no model, so each is matched here by hand, in kie-models.json's price format. A setting the model takes but media-generator doesn't send prices at Kie's default (Ideogram BALANCED, Kling 3.0 motion control 720p, Wan 2.6 Flash without audio, Grok's videos 6 s); a « per megapixel » row counts one. `none`: the catalog's models with no row. Checked against Kie's list by test/kie-live.test.js (2026-10-31)",
